<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonld={jsonld} navVariant="inner">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Bundle</span>
<h1>First Order Shield: your first India order, covered end to end</h1>
<p class="lead">First orders carry every risk at once—unknown supplier, deposit exposure, no golden history. The Shield bundles the three services that cover each, at one fixed price.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>1 · Supplier Verification</h3><p>Before the deposit: premises, documents, manufacturer-vs-trader verdict in 3 working days.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/during-production-inspection/"><h3>2 · During-Production Inspection</h3><p>At 20–50% complete: moisture, first-offs and finish direction while rework is still cheap.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>3 · Pre-Shipment Inspection</h3><p>Before the balance payment: AQL 2.5 sampling, full checklist, photographed report in 24 hours.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/container-loading-supervision/"><h3>Optional · Container Loading</h3><p>Add CLS to witness the tally, dunnage and seal—nothing ships unseen.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><p class="prose rv">Priced below the three services booked separately, sequenced so each stage de-risks the next, and coordinated by one inspector who knows your order from verification to container. The Shield also comes with the contract language that makes it work: a deposit released only after verification, and a balance payable against the passed PSI report. Tell us your product and supplier—fixed quote within 2 hours.</p></div></section>
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
